sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant C as BlogController
  participant M as Blog (model)
  participant V as BlogView
  U->>C: addBlog(title, content, author)
  C->>M: new Blog(...)
  C->>C: store the blog in the list
  U->>C: showBlog(0)
  C->>M: read the blog
  C->>V: displayBlogDetails(blog)
  V-->>U: shows the blog
